  (text "FRONT PANEL - 2-layer 180 x 65 mm; copper = AGND, joined to GND only through the main-board star" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 11.27 8.73 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bb7fd998-1fb1-57f8-832b-25bb9c190917"))
  (text "J1 is mounted on the BACK of the panel: female pad 2k-1 mates with link pin 2k and pad 2k with link pin 2k-1 (mirrored footprint). Net names follow the link pins (brief 7.8, v0.7 pins 37-40)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 16 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "58f5270c-a207-5e88-8cfc-1d10922feeb8"))
  (text "TRIG: 5 V into open circuit, about 2.4 V into 50 ohm (74LVC1T45 + 33 ohm). AI1..AI8 +-10 V, 1 kOhm series on the main board. AO1/AO2 +-10 V, 49.9 ohm back-terminated." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1f82c5bc-6d20-50a6-be5b-c3631261b502"))
  (text "RX (link pin 37) = NMR receive coil into the LNA (section A); TX (link pin 39) = NMR transmit coil from the OPA564 stage (section B); AGND on pins 38/40 beside them. SPARE: SMA shield to AGND, centre pin to test pad TP1 only." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 24 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9b560fde-2736-55c0-b952-664e82987792"))
